+   WeatherBench 2: A Benchmark for the Next Generation of Data-Driven Global Weather Models. Journal of Advances
+   in Modeling Earth Systems, 16(6), e2023MS004019, 2024; first authors Rasp S, Hoyer S, Merose A, Langmore I,
+   Battaglia P (18 authors).
+
+5. The ERA5 product WeatherBench 2's climatology is computed from (hourly ERA5; this build did not read the CDS):
